# Files the build should NOT copy into the image (faster builds, smaller image, no secret leaks).
# Secrets — never commit real credentials.
**/.env

# Downloaded media (re-hosted photos). Regenerated at runtime; no need to track.
**/media

# Python bytecode + caches.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]

# Virtual environments.
**/.venv
**/venv

# OS noise.
**/.DS_Store
